# Phase 10's agent answers. The path this rule named stopped existing when the
# cache was split per provider, so it has matched nothing since and both
# caches have been tracked. Left tracked deliberately rather than re-ignored:
# "regenerable" was the original reason to exclude it, and that stopped being
# the operative fact once regeneration became four days of rate-limited free
# quota. It is 392K, it is the only copy, and losing it would mean Phase 10
# could not finish. The stale path is kept below so the rule's history is
# visible rather than silently deleted.
#   results/phase10/agent_cache.json   <- matched until the per-provider split
